Remove the crush update-providers command (PATCH_OUT_UPDATE_PROVIDERS_CMD, default 1).

This user-initiated command is the one path to catwalk.charm.land that the
default-providers-false gate does not cover (internal/config/provider.go:60,67).
In the local-first runCrush setup the provider catalog is suppressed by design,
so the command has nothing useful to fetch. Deregistering it makes it
unreachable; updateProvidersCmd stays defined (unused package var is legal Go).

